sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Foydalanuvchi
    participant B as Brauzer
    participant N as WhiteNoise + Gunicorn
    participant D as Django views
    participant S as Service layer
    participant C as Redis cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as Celery
    participant API as Tashqi API

    U->>B: /en/analytics/
    B->>N: HTTPS GET
    N->>D: WSGI request
    D->>S: analytics_overview(user)
    S->>C: cache.get("kpis:user_id")
    alt Cache hit (5 min TTL)
        C-->>S: cached dict
    else Cache miss
        S->>DB: SELECT posts, comments, sentiment
        DB-->>S: rowlar
        S->>S: aggregate (Counter, Avg)
        S->>C: cache.set, ex=300
    end
    S-->>D: ctx dict
    D->>D: render(template, ctx)
    D-->>N: HTML 200
    N-->>B: gzip + cookies
    B-->>U: KPI cards, charts

    Note over Q,API: Fonda — har 6 soat
    Q->>DB: SocialAccount.filter(is_active=True)
    DB-->>Q: 7 ta akkaunt
    loop har akkaunt
        Q->>API: fetch_posts() / comments()
        API-->>Q: JSON
        Q->>DB: bulk_create + update_or_create
        Q->>Q: VADER / XLM-RoBERTa
        Q->>DB: SentimentResult.create
    end
    Q->>DB: anomaly z-score → Alert.create
    Q->>U: SMTP email (agar yangi alert)
